<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Andi" data-copy-zh="Andi">Andi</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Follow Andi’s personal route, plan dates and Private Time, and check her one-time gift." data-copy-zh="推进 Andi 的个人路线，安排约会与独处，并查看一次性礼物的条件。">Follow Andi’s personal route, plan dates and Private Time, and check her one-time gift.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Getting to know Andi</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">First access and daily hours</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Visits and Heart-to-Hearts</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Daily affection, dates and later visits</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">When progress pauses</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">认识 Andi</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">初次解锁与每天的时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">剧情拜访与谈心顺序</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">日常好感、约会与后续拜访</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时先检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Percentage_Needed"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_the_Score_Vanished"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Approved_Topic"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Complete_Romance_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="How_to_Meet_Andi"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Getting to know Andi</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Andi — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/andi.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Andi — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/andi.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Andi — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Andi’s Future route combines six visits, three evening Heart-to-Hearts and four optional dates. Meet her at the Human Interaction Optimization Center, then return as your relationship grows.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>First access and daily hours</h2><p>Go to <strong>Future → Fringe Zone → Human Interaction Optimization Center</strong>. Learn <strong>System Hacking</strong> and successfully use <strong>Hack Social Algorithms</strong> there: each attempt costs <strong>30 minutes and 15 Energy</strong>. Its chance is Technology −20, plus 5 for each of AI Programming and Digital Forensics, bounded to 5–95%. A failed attempt sends you back to the Nova’s Quantum Research Lab; return and try again.</p><p>Visit the center <strong>11:00–20:59</strong> for <strong>One Hundred Percent</strong>. Afterwards, Andi’s portrait is available there during those same hours every day. The hack and introduction are both required.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Visits and Heart-to-Hearts</h2><p>The six visits below happen automatically when you enter the center at <strong>11:00–20:59</strong> with their requirements met. Work the evening conversations into the chain; affection alone does not replace them.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Visit in order</th><th scope="col">Affection needed</th><th scope="col">Earlier step</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">One Hundred Percent</th><td data-label="Affection needed">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Earlier step">Successful social-center hack</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seven Point Four Minutes</th><td data-label="Affection needed">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Earlier step">One Hundred Percent</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Backup Boyfriend</th><td data-label="Affection needed">Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Earlier step">Seven Point Four Minutes + No Approved Topic</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Terms of Service</th><td data-label="Affection needed">Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Earlier step">Backup Boyfriend + If the Score Vanished</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Compatibility Audit</th><td data-label="Affection needed">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Earlier step">Terms of Service</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Manual Choice</th><td data-label="Affection needed">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Earlier step">Compatibility Audit</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Heart-to-Heart</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Start</th><th scope="col">Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">No Approved Topic</th><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)；Seven Point Four Minutes</td><td data-label="Start">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost">75 min</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">If the Score Vanished</th><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400)；Backup Boyfriend + first H 2 H</td><td data-label="Start">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost">90 min</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Percentage Needed</th><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800)；Manual Choice + previous H 2 H</td><td data-label="Start">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost">90 min</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Each Heart-to-Heart completes once. These three have no additional Wealth, Energy or Calm cost. The four dates below are optional and do not gate the six-visit route.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Actions"></span><h2>Daily affection, dates and later visits</h2><p><strong>Talk:</strong>15 minutes, 2 base affection, three positive talks daily. At <strong>Known (25)</strong>, <strong>Give Chocolate</strong> takes 10 minutes and one Chocolate for 5 base affection, twice daily. Her preferred stats are <strong>Charm 65, Communication 65 and Luck 60</strong>; learned <strong>Empathy</strong> improves gains.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Optional date</th><th scope="col">Relationship</th><th scope="col">Start</th><th scope="col">Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Neon Bazaar Date</th><td data-label="Relationship">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Start">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost">120 min; $80</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Skygarden Date</th><td data-label="Relationship">Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Start">11:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost">120 min; $100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Glass Reef Date</th><td data-label="Relationship">Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Start">11:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost">120 min; $120</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Memory Arcade Date</th><td data-label="Relationship">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Start">17:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost">120 min; $150</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Each date completes once and has no additional Energy or Calm cost. They open by relationship stage, without requiring the personal plots or Heart-to-Hearts.</p><p>After <strong>Manual Choice</strong> and <strong>No Percentage Needed</strong>, <strong>Private Time with Andi</strong> opens at <strong>Romantic (800)</strong>: start from her center portrait during <strong>11:00–20:59</strong>, once daily, for <strong>120 minutes and 25 Energy</strong>. This visit requires the paid-content unlock shown by the game. Its family-planning choice is optional. It additionally needs Pregnancy enabled and unlocked for Andi, Akira’s protocol complete, at least 2000 affection and 500 NPC intimacy XP, and no existing pregnancy/recovery or child together. See Pregnancy for the later visits and timing.</p><p>At <strong>In Love (3000)</strong>, with those same two milestones complete, choose <strong>Andi’s Gift</strong>: <strong>30 minutes</strong>, once, with no extra resource or item cost. It awards <strong>Heart’s Echo</strong>, which gives positive NPC affection awards an <strong>8% chance to double</strong> after other bonuses, subject to normal progression caps. Already owning the gift, including a retained New Game+ copy, prevents a duplicate claim.</p><p>Affection figures are base values before favorite-stat and learned-skill bonuses. Ordinary affection sets the relationship stage; each activity still has its own prerequisites. Listed time windows are start times; their ending hour is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>When progress pauses</h2><ul><li>No portrait: finish the successful hack and One Hundred Percent, then return during 11:00–20:59.</li><li>Backup Boyfriend and Terms of Service require their earlier evening Heart-to-Hearts. Check the completed conversation as well as affection.</li><li>Private Time needs No Percentage Needed, Romantic affection, the appropriate content unlock and an unused daily visit.</li><li>Andi’s Gift is a separate In Love action; Private Time does not substitute for it.</li><li>Pregnancy follow-ups use the same center and daytime schedule; consult the Pregnancy guide rather than waiting in an apartment location.</li><li>Respect the separate three-talk and two-Chocolate daily allowances; extra attempts can annoy her.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — affection and Heart-to-Hearts</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Skills — System Hacking and affection bonuses</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">Pregnancy — optional family planning and follow-ups</a></li><li><a href="items.html">Items — gifts and permanent rewards</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Locations — Future Fringe Zone</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Percentage_Needed"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_the_Score_Vanished"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Approved_Topic"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Complete_Romance_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-How_to_Meet_Andi"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>认识 Andi</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Andi 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/andi.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Andi 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/andi.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Andi 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Andi 的未来路线有六次剧情拜访、三次晚间谈心，以及四场可选约会。先在人类互动优化中心认识她，再随着关系提升回来推进。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>初次解锁与每天的时间</h2><p>前往<strong>未来 → 边缘区 → 人类互动优化中心</strong>。学会<strong>系统黑客</strong>后，在这里成功使用<strong>「入侵社交算法」</strong>；每次尝试消耗<strong>30 分钟、15 精力</strong>。成功率为科技 −20，再为「AI编程」与「数字取证」各加 5，最低 5%、最高 95%。失败会被送回Nova的量子研究实验室，之后可以回来重试。</p><p>成功后在<strong>11:00–20:59</strong>进入中心，完成<strong>「百分之百」</strong>。之后每天同一时段都能见到 Andi 的头像；成功入侵与初次剧情缺一不可。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>剧情拜访与谈心顺序</h2><p>下列六次剧情会在条件齐全、<strong>11:00–20:59</strong>进入中心时自动发生。记得穿插晚间谈心，单靠提高好感不能跳过。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">按顺序拜访</th><th scope="col">关系要求</th><th scope="col">先完成</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">百分之百</th><td data-label="关系要求">陌生人（Stranger，0）</td><td data-label="先完成">成功入侵互动中心</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">七点四分钟</th><td data-label="关系要求">已知（Known，25）</td><td data-label="先完成">完成「百分之百」</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">备用男友</th><td data-label="关系要求">亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</td><td data-label="先完成">完成「七点四分钟」与「不按规定话题聊」</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">服务条款</th><td data-label="关系要求">迷恋（Crush，400）</td><td data-label="先完成">完成「备用男友」与「如果分数消失」</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">兼容性审查</th><td data-label="关系要求">浪漫感（Romantic，800）</td><td data-label="先完成">完成「服务条款」</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">自主选择</th><td data-label="关系要求">浪漫感（Romantic，800）</td><td data-label="先完成">完成「兼容性审查」</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">谈心</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">不按规定话题聊</th><td data-label="条件">朋友（Friend，100）；完成「七点四分钟」</td><td data-label="开始时段">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗">75 分钟</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">如果分数消失</th><td data-label="条件">迷恋（Crush，400）；完成「备用男友」与上一次谈心</td><td data-label="开始时段">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗">90 分钟</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不需要百分比</th><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（Romantic，800）；完成「自主选择」与上一次谈心</td><td data-label="开始时段">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗">90 分钟</td></tr></tbody></table><p>每次谈心只完成一次，这三次没有额外的财富、精力或镇定消耗。下面四场约会都是可选内容，不是六次剧情的前置条件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Actions"></span><h2>日常好感、约会与后续拜访</h2><p><strong>交谈：</strong>15 分钟、2 点基础好感，每天三次正向收益。到<strong>已知（Known，25）</strong>后可<strong>赠送巧克力</strong>：10 分钟、1 份巧克力、5 点基础好感，每天两次。她偏好的属性是<strong>魅力 65、沟通 65、幸运 60</strong>，学会<strong>共情</strong>也能提高收益。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">可选约会</th><th scope="col">关系要求</th><th scope="col">开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">霓虹集市约会</th><td data-label="关系要求">朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="开始时段">18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗">120 分钟；80 财富</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">空中花园约会</th><td data-label="关系要求">亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</td><td data-label="开始时段">11:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗">120 分钟；100 财富</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">玻璃礁约会</th><td data-label="关系要求">迷恋（Crush，400）</td><td data-label="开始时段">11:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗">120 分钟；120 财富</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">记忆游戏厅约会</th><td data-label="关系要求">浪漫感（Romantic，800）</td><td data-label="开始时段">17:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗">120 分钟；150 财富</td></tr></tbody></table><p>每场约会只完成一次，没有额外精力或镇定消耗；只看关系阶段，不要求先完成个人剧情或谈心。</p><p>完成<strong>「自主选择」</strong>与<strong>「不需要百分比」</strong>，并达到<strong>浪漫感（Romantic，800）</strong>后，可在中心头像选择<strong>「与 Andi 独处」</strong>。开始时段为<strong>11:00–20:59</strong>，每天一次，消耗<strong>120 分钟、25 精力</strong>；需要游戏提示的付费内容解锁。是否规划家庭由你选择。还须为 Andi 解锁并启用怀孕内容、完成 Akira 的妊娠规程、达到 2000 好感与 500 人物亲密经验，且没有正在怀孕、产后恢复或已经共同抚养的孩子。后续拜访与时间见怀孕指南。</p><p>达到<strong>恋爱中（In Love，3000）</strong>，并完成同样两个节点后，可选择<strong>「Andi 的礼物」</strong>：<strong>30 分钟</strong>、仅一次，没有额外资源或物品消耗。奖励<strong>心之回响</strong>，让正向人物好感在其他加成结算后有<strong>8% 概率翻倍</strong>，仍受正常进度上限限制。已经持有，包括新游戏＋保留的副本时，不能重复领取。</p><p>表中的好感是基础值，会受到偏好属性、已学技能等加成影响。关系阶段取决于普通好感，其他活动的前置条件仍需分别满足。时间范围表示开始行动的时段，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时先检查</h2><ul><li>没有头像：确认入侵成功、完成「百分之百」，再于 11:00–20:59 回来。</li><li>「备用男友」与「服务条款」都要求先完成对应的晚间谈心；好感够了也不能跳过。</li><li>私人时光需要「不需要百分比」、浪漫感、对应内容解锁，以及当天尚未用过的次数。</li><li>「Andi 的礼物」是恋爱中阶段的独立行动，私人时光不能代替它。</li><li>怀孕后续仍在中心的日间时段触发，按怀孕指南检查，不必去另一个公寓地点等候。</li><li>每天三次交谈、两次巧克力分别计数，超过次数可能惹她不快，隔天再来即可。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系：好感与谈心</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">技能：系统黑客与好感加成</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">怀孕：家庭规划与后续拜访</a></li><li><a href="items.html">物品：礼物与永久奖励</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">地点：未来边缘区</a></li></ul></section>
